[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 368.15, "timestamp": "00:06:08", "text": "兌換各種東西。正確的。所以，這裡有個手錶連續觀看次數的統計功能。呃，你觀看主播的次數越多，就能獲得一定數量的積分。就是這樣。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 378.339, "timestamp": "00:06:18", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/aACLJToYP6FMtiMkCyV12FJchjJLrwy1qzEVqHiZEyFaZdsbRkj-yqg_i_m8eqjYX-fTLgPLCzk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hm 🤔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 381.51, "timestamp": "00:06:21", "text": "那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 384.79, "timestamp": "00:06:24", "text": "Twitch的東西。  也包括踢腿。踢球時也有同樣的狀況。呃，沒有手錶技巧，但他們有頻道積分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 387.189, "timestamp": "00:06:27", "text": "。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 390.07, "timestamp": "00:06:30", "text": "我把我在 Twitch 頻道上擁有的所有積分都同步到了踢人名單裡"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 391.773, "timestamp": "00:06:31", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/aACLJToYP6FMtiMkCyV12FJchjJLrwy1qzEVqHiZEyFaZdsbRkj-yqg_i_m8eqjYX-fTLgPLCzk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "genshine when ? 😑"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 406.521, "timestamp": "00:06:46", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/aACLJToYP6FMtiMkCyV12FJchjJLrwy1qzEVqHiZEyFaZdsbRkj-yqg_i_m8eqjYX-fTLgPLCzk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "-_-"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 413.519, "timestamp": "00:06:53", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/aACLJToYP6FMtiMkCyV12FJchjJLrwy1qzEVqHiZEyFaZdsbRkj-yqg_i_m8eqjYX-fTLgPLCzk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you just don't want play"}]